menuconfig MODULES_CAMERA_TIMESYNC
	bool "camera_timesync"
	default n
	depends on DRIVERS_CAMERA_CAPTURE
	---help---
		Strobe-based clock sync: matches companion camera frame stamps
		(camera_frame_stamp) with the camera_capture strobe edges
		(camera_trigger) and publishes the measured clock offset for the
		uXRCE-DDS client.
